  "content_html": "<h1>moments in an unfinished painting</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">Jun 29 2025</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"05201\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open moments in an unfinished painting\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05201-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05201-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05201-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05201-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"moments in an unfinished painting\" width=\"3152\" height=\"1776\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>moments in an unfinished painting</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\na painting is a living thing\nit flows from life and reveals life\nwhilst being outside of life\nit is born but it never breathes\nas if it is constantly in the process of birth\n<p>yet it bares many scars, already\nscratched, dissolved, scrubbed\nyet every violent act is done with love\nand hope\nthat the layers will reveal an impermanence</p>\n<p>many years pass… it is still not yet ready\nit is still of the unnameable\nand when it becomes time\nit will rest, still\nbeyond the reach of clocks\n</pre></p>\n",
